<h2 id="what-is-a-learning-path">What is a Learning Path?</h2>

<p>A learning path is a structured sequence of courses, modules, or milestones designed to guide learners through a comprehensive educational journey. It helps learners achieve specific learning goals by following a predefined roadmap. Learning paths ensure that learners progress logically and systematically, building on their knowledge and skills as they advance.</p>

<p><br /></p>

